A container in a host body owns a line past its own content column

```
- a
  ::: note
   [r]: /url
  :::

[r][]
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
      <p>[r]: /url</p>
    </aside>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>[r][]</p>
```

```
:: t
:  a
   ::: note
    [r]: /url
   :::

[r][]
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>a</p>
    <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">

    </aside>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p><a href="/url">r</a></p>
```

```
see[^f]

[^f]: a
    > q
     [r]: /url

[r][]
.
<p>see<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<p><a href="/url">r</a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>a</p>
      <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
      <p><a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```

```
> a
> ::: note
>  [r]: /url
> :::

[r][]
.
<blockquote>
  <p>a</p>
  <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
    <p>[r]: /url</p>
  </aside>
</blockquote>
<p>[r][]</p>
```

```
- a
  > q
   [r]: /url

[r][]
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
<p><a href="/url">r</a></p>
```

```
:: t
:  a
   > q
    [r]: /url

[r][]
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>
    <p>a</p>
    <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
  </dd>
</dl>
<p><a href="/url">r</a></p>
```

```
- a
  ::: note
   first

   second
  :::
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
      <p>first</p>
      <p>second</p>
    </aside>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  > q
   first

   second
.
<ul>
  <li><p>a</p>
    <blockquote><p>q
first</p></blockquote>
    <p>second</p>
  </li>
</ul>
```

